Etetőcumi Canpol babies Natural Shape, 3 hó+, 2 db:





	The Canpol babies Natural Shape teat for babies from 3 months respects the natural rhythm of sucking and is a suitable choice when combining breastfeeding with bottle feeding or when feeding with expressed milk. The dual-zone teat with DuoFlex technology, developed in collaboration with a neurologopedist, mimics the behaviour of the breast during breastfeeding – milk flows only during active sucking, the flexible tip copies the movement of the nipple and the wide, stable base supports the natural 'fish-like' position of the lips. This allows the baby to suck smoothly without interruption or excessive air swallowing, which helps reduce the risk of colic and tummy ache. The Canpol babies Natural Shape teat is made from high-quality, BPA-free silicone, with a texture that mimics a mother's nipple. The teat is compatible with Canpol babies Natural Shape bottles (150ml, 260ml or 330ml).&nbsp;


















